        "after": "<div><section data-cim-renderer=\"console/v1\" data-step=\"read-a-value--s01\"><header data-role=\"titlebar\"><span data-role=\"title\">Python interactive examples</span></header><div data-role=\"transcript\"><div data-role=\"entry\" data-beat=\"read-a-value\"><div data-role=\"command-line\"><span data-role=\"prompt\">&gt;&gt;&gt;</span><span data-role=\"prompt-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> </span><span data-role=\"command\">2</span><span data-role=\"cursor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div></div></div></section></div><div><div data-cim-selected=\"false\" data-cim-step-id=\"read-a-value--s01\" aria-current=\"step\"><button type=\"button\"></button><p>An expression describes a value. Here Python adds two integers.</p></div><div hidden=\"\" data-cim-selected=\"false\"><button type=\"button\"></button><p></p></div><div hidden=\"\" data-cim-selected=\"false\"><button type=\"button\"></button><p></p></div><div hidden=\"\" data-cim-selected=\"false\"><button type=\"button\"></button><p></p></div><div hidden=\"\" data-cim-selected=\"false\"><button type=\"button\"></button><p></p><a></a></div></div>"
